  "description": "The meme’s use of a traumatic event to create a dramatic visual and textual impact is an example of sensationalism — a media strategy that emphasizes shocking or emotionally charged content to attract attention. This concept is not visible in the image but is necessary to understand the meme’s intent and cultural context.",
